# Project agent-core overlay (optional)

If your project already has an alwaysApply agent-core rule, copy relevant bullets below. Link to package rules for full Confirm text.

## Before coding (add under 动手前 / Before coding)

1. Read **`AGENTS.md`** at project root first (`.cursor/rules/workspace-agent-gate.mdc`).
2. If shared utils may apply: understand task / read business code → Identify → Read called export(s) → **Confirm (Q1–Q5) + Verdict（最终）** in chat **before first Write** (`.cursor/rules/utils-reuse-gate.mdc`).

## Do not

- Skip `AGENTS.md` because rules summarized it
- Verdict reuse without Read of export(s) you will call
- Skip Confirm because WIP already imports utils
- Write `.utils-discovery-cache.json`

Default Hook is **remind** only. Optional `hookMode: confirm` — see package README.
